    "identifier": "konjiki-steel-release-steel-rain",
    "description": "<p>You manifest numerous thrown weapons such as Shuriken or Kunai at a point within 60 feet and unleash all of them upon all targets within a 15-foot sphere. All creatures within range must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking your [Weapons Damage] + 1d10 and gaining one rank of Weakened on a failed saving throw, or half damage and no effects on a successful saving throw.</p>\n<p>Alomancy Infusion. If you have the Superheavy Metals or Metallic Fan Alomancy Technique, you can spend 1 ingot to magnify the weight of the weapons used, causing creatures who fail their saving throw to be knocked Prone.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank for each rank, you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10.</p>",
